---
description: Wording for wpcore's output, errors and docs
alwaysApply: true
---

# User-facing copy

- Short, plain, specific: say what is wrong and what to do ("core 6.8 is not
  installed: sudo wpcore add 6.8"), not that "an error occurred".
- Name real things: paths, commands, versions, in `code` style in docs.
- No em dashes in new text. No exclamation marks.
